# Files under src/bundles/ are byte-exact Parcel output. Any end-of-line or
# encoding normalisation would change their bytes and break `npm run verify`,
# which compares against the recorded digests. Mark them binary so git stores
# and checks them out verbatim.
src/bundles/** -text -diff

# The same applies to the recorded module manifests and the baseline archive.
*.crx binary
